{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stellar Watch is a roguelite tower defense where you don\u2019t just place towers\u2014you fly the frontline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate your starship to steer a formation of drones. Aim fire, shield weak flanks, and carve safe flight paths through procedural waves of enemies. Every wave is a spatial puzzle: demanding instant reads, real-time control, and precise execution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058070/extras/324337a8d398446140fdf35bcc40f64f.avif?t=1770322761\" alt=\"SPIN TO WIN\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Line up fire arcs, link beams, and intercept threats in real time. Choose your tempo: sharp pivots to open kill windows, or steady holds to protect a weak side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058070/extras/bd4825e0fda0dee9cfefd9145c0b7dc5.poster.avif?t=1770322761\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058070/extras/bd4825e0fda0dee9cfefd9145c0b7dc5.webm?t=1770322761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058070/extras/bd4825e0fda0dee9cfefd9145c0b7dc5.mp4?t=1770322761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058070/extras/b12cb5490dd84eb50d9c3e2e2016af8b.avif?t=1770322761\" alt=\"MASTER SPATIAL AWARENESS\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drones have HP. Collide with enemies or hazards like black holes, and they break. Will you chase perfect angles or play to survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058070/extras/a853612eb449dae368b05286e2e7cb68.poster.avif?t=1770322761\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058070/extras/a853612eb449dae368b05286e2e7cb68.webm?t=1770322761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058070/extras/a853612eb449dae368b05286e2e7cb68.mp4?t=1770322761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058070/extras/a502870d587efd2a0a467049866b92d0.avif?t=1770322761\" alt=\"EVOLVE YOUR DRONES\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock starships with unique handling and layouts. Draft and upgrade 11 distinct drones to forge wild synergies \u2014 hunt enemies with blades, or spin a death web around them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058070/extras/9328490284c556cadf5196378a53d17c.poster.avif?t=1770322761\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058070/extras/9328490284c556cadf5196378a53d17c.webm?t=1770322761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058070/extras/9328490284c556cadf5196378a53d17c.mp4?t=1770322761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058070/extras/093de5cb545a05f6e05cb30d18c00d7c.avif?t=1770322761\" alt=\"ADAPT TO HAZARDS\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black holes and anomalies bend the battlefield for both sides. Procedural enemy paths rewrite the fight; adapt, react, and master the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058070/extras/49e5fdc58b9eeaa2445ab1c97e610d69.poster.avif?t=1770322761\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058070/extras/49e5fdc58b9eeaa2445ab1c97e610d69.webm?t=1770322761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058070/extras/49e5fdc58b9eeaa2445ab1c97e610d69.mp4?t=1770322761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058070/extras/438e14e6b41c5e74c3267d7520780950.avif?t=1770322761\" alt=\"CHOOSE YOUR CHALLENGE\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explorer is a relaxed run. Defender brings classic tower defense turned brutal. Ranger ups the stakes with persistent hull damage \u2014 where every move could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058070/extras/c27e43ea1a25dcf574049bc4cc48b575.poster.avif?t=1770322761\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058070/extras/c27e43ea1a25dcf574049bc4cc48b575.webm?t=1770322761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058070/extras/c27e43ea1a25dcf574049bc4cc48b575.mp4?t=1770322761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stellar Watch is an elite force guarding stars from creatures of the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Watch!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2058070?t=1770322761","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058070/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770322761","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058070/d6362576c5e1f73c5ed554c559e6d19a6c7d78bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770322761","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058070/d6362576c5e1f73c5ed554c559e6d19a6c7d78bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770322761","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2249410,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stellar Watch is a roguelite tower defense where you don\u2019t just place towers\u2014you fly the frontline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate your starship to steer a formation of drones. Aim fire, shield weak flanks, and carve safe flight paths through procedural waves of enemies. Every wave is a spatial puzzle: demanding instant reads, real-time control, and precise execution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058070/extras/324337a8d398446140fdf35bcc40f64f.avif?t=1770322761\" alt=\"SPIN TO WIN\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Line up fire arcs, link beams, and intercept threats in real time. Choose your tempo: sharp pivots to open kill windows, or steady holds to protect a weak side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><